{"version":1,"content":"<p>有海外媒體介紹了一段關於Rockstar Games旗下《GTA6》（《GTA6》）的視頻，稱一名住在多米尼加共和國某地的男子花了大約一周下載這款遊戲，進度卻仍只有92%。這款遊戲的數據大小約為210GB，體量特別大。遊戲剛發售時，還有一家德國企業報告稱，數據通信費創下了歷史新高。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1588306.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T07:47:10.610890+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:15:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:31.447730+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:31.447730+00:00","content_hash":"315858682620e07a0eaa2fee26644cfa2eb6830fe421942ed5d9793e5573472d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}